      "content": "hey so i hit my head on my kitchen cabinet earlier. its just a little bump and i have a mild headache but nothing is bleeding or anything. i do take eliquis for my afib though so i wasnt sure... do i need to go to the er or can i just keep an eye on it at home for a bit?",
